The '''Ender Artifact'''&nbsp;is an {{Epic}} [[Accessory]] that can be bought from the [[Dark Auction]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Dark Auction ===
The '''Ender Artifact''' has a chance to appear in round 1, 3 or 4 of the [[Dark Auction]] with starting bid of {{c|20000000}}. 

=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Ender Artifact''' can also be obtained as a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|rarity = epic
|special_effect = Reduces the damage taken from {{mt|Ender}} mobs by {{Green|20%}}.
}}
This accessory is quite important to have when on {{Zone|The End}} island for fighting higher tiers of the [[Voidgloom Seraph]].

